This crate is a Rust translation of parts of the Soar kernel
(https://github.com/SoarGroup/Soar), pinned at commit
3fc337a1ab2d04b9e5183335c1496d7dcdc57c1c (2026-10-07), distributed under
the BSD licence reproduced in LICENSE-SOAR-BSD.md.

src/rng.rs translates Soar's soar_rand.h, which is Richard J. Wagner's
MersenneTwister.h v1.0, based on code by Makoto Matsumoto, Takuji
Nishimura and Shawn Cokus, Copyright (C) 1997-2002 Makoto Matsumoto and
Takuji Nishimura, Copyright (C) 2000-2003 Richard J. Wagner, under a BSD
licence (reproduced in the header of src/rng.rs).

